{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04389","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十五 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵人难得意，赏爱在须臾。\n莫以心如玉，探他明月珠。\n昔称夭桃子，今爲舂市徒。\n鸱鴞悲东国，麋鹿泣姑苏。\n谁见鸱夷子，扁舟去五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}